# Private keys, all of them. minisign.pub is committed on purpose; its secret
# half never is, nor is any CA or leaf key a drill happens to mint in the tree.
# Belt and braces, so a keypair generated here by accident cannot be staged.
# See docs/release-signing.md.
*.key
